%% UNKNOWN is an explanatory outcome, not a persisted status. SUCCEEDED/FAILED are the principal terminal outcomes shown. Legacy FAILED_CONFIRMED guards also exist; this is not a complete transition inventory or proof of all replay safety.
stateDiagram-v2
    state "PENDING / Funds reserved by creation transaction" as PENDING
    state "PROCESSING / Conditional claim before PayOS call" as PROCESSING
    state "SUCCEEDED / Accepted provider success" as SUCCEEDED
    state "FAILED / Confirmed failure + guarded refund" as FAILED
    state "Unknown provider outcome / Keep PROCESSING; reconcile later" as UNKNOWN
    PENDING --> PROCESSING: Atomic claim
    PROCESSING --> SUCCEEDED: Verified success / reconciliation
    PROCESSING --> FAILED: Confirmed failure
    PROCESSING --> UNKNOWN: Timeout / uncertain result
    UNKNOWN --> PROCESSING: Reconcile; no immediate refund
